&lt;li&gt;Collaborative Creation: Understand user needs and business goals to co-create product content alongside design and product management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Content Design: Apply and evolve content strategies, guidelines, and processes. Create deliverables such as content audits, research-driven frameworks, and user personas.&lt;/li&gt;
