&lt;p&gt;The Dashboards team builds the data visualization experiences that help Smartsheet customers turn raw information into clear, executive-ready insight. We&#39;re a vibrant team with engineers at every level — from early-career to senior — and we&#39;re responsible for the beautiful data visualizations that help our customers make confident, timely executive decisions. We&#39;re growing our investment in AI-powered features and modern data infrastructure, and we&#39;re looking for an Engineering Manager to help lead the team through this next chapter.&lt;/p&gt;
