&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of direct sales success in the Federal Civilian Government market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a hunter with a history of developing new prospective customers and collaborating across others teams, ensuring target quotas are exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
