&lt;p&gt;As a global leader in Intelligent Work Management with a market cap of $10bn, we’ve continued to scale our engineering presence internationally. Since expanding into Bulgaria in October 2024, we’ve grown to a team of 75+ engineers. As we continue expanding into Bulgaria and build our operation, we&#39;re searching for a talented and motivated Engineering Manager. Our business is built on finding exceptional talent and empowering them to build and improve our service offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work remotely from Bulgaria and will be reporting to an Engineering Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of software engineers to deliver great products to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development and success of one or more products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and inspire your team to achieve quality software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partners across the company, including product management, UX, and customer teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish lean engineering processes that use collaboration and rapid iteration to build the right product for the right problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and grow your team by promoting engineering excellence and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 8+ years of software engineering experience and 3+ years managing software engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep software development skills in at least one systems development language, such as Java, Go, C++, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with modern technology stacks with a passion for building scalable, highly available customer-facing cloud applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in a technology that you&#39;re personally excited about, such as distributed systems, systems automation, and cloud technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like to dive in, learn new things, and want to build outstanding products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legally eligible to work in Bulgaria on an ongoing basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in English is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
