&lt;p&gt;Smartsheet is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Architect &lt;/strong&gt;to drive quality, efficiency and customer satisfaction within our Professional Services’ business by leading customer conversations and assisting customers with developing, building, testing and deploying solutions that leverage Smartsheet, the Smartsheet API and integrations between Smartsheet and other products. The right candidate will have a passion for working with leading edge, web-based, and AI-powered technologies and a desire to deeply understand Smartsheet’s benefits, use cases, and business and technical elements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect, you will work with Smartsheet customers and partners on engagements to convert business requirements into Smartsheet solutions. Within this role, you will be considered the Subject Matter Expert pertaining to advanced Smartsheet functionalities in order to propose solutions for use cases across different industries and business groups. The right candidate is a strong communicator, detail-oriented, and is motivated by both working independently and leading impactful customer conversations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the &lt;strong&gt;Director, Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt;. This is a remote eligible position and you may work remotely from anywhere in the US where Smartsheet is registered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, build, test and deploy custom software solutions leveraging a wide array of Smartsheet product &amp;amp; third party APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build AI-powered workflows and automations — leveraging LLMs, AI agents, and Smartsheet’s native AI capabilities — to solve customer problems that traditional configuration can’t&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI coding assistants such as Claude Code to accelerate custom development, prototyping, and solution delivery across customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging AI tools and techniques and apply them to accelerate time-to-value for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical consulting engagements that require custom software development by leading design sessions, defining technical requirements, and validating solution architecture against product best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and document technical solutions aligned with client business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with customer teams throughout an engagement, embedding deeply enough in their workflows to translate real-world pain points into working solutions quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly prototype and iterate on solutions in close collaboration with customers, refining scope and design based on hands-on feedback rather than waiting for formal review cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solutions end-to-end — from initial discovery through deployment, adoption, and ongoing refinement in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable components, frameworks, and accelerators that can be extended and redeployed across future customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Smartsheet subject matter expert (SME) on Smartsheet product capabilities and AI-powered extensibility scenarios that leverage the API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all aspects of technical projects, including, but not limited to, the schedule, deliverables, deadlines and client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical delivery of custom development, integrations, and data migration elements of a Smartsheet implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a target billable utilization aligned to the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to our Product &amp;amp; Platform Engineering teams that inform product improvements and identify feature gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years relevant work experience or equivalent combination of relevant work experience and education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience with two or more of our primary languages (.Net, NodeJS, Python, Java, Ruby)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-stack development skills, with the ability to independently design, build, and ship production-quality applications — not just configure existing tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI/LLM technologies and experience integrating them into applications via APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of prompt engineering and AI agent design patterns, with curiosity for applying AI to solve real business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted development tools such as Claude Code, with comfort integrating them into a daily engineering workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel periodically (up to 15%) based on customer and business need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills (written, verbal, presentation), with the ability to explain technical subjects to non-technical end user personnel in large enterprises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive projects from concept through completion with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer facing experience&lt;/li&gt;
