&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SaaS/IPaaS applications in an enterprise environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of systems architecture and ability to design scalable performance-driven solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of key design patterns and large data volume best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data integration and experience integrating SaaS applications with different business systems (ETL, CRM, business analytics, reporting, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
