&lt;li&gt;Establish regional sales playbooks and demonstrate thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic account relationships across executive leadership, develop 5-year account plans for key customers and drive expansion revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish regional sales playbooks, thought-leadership, maintain accurate forecasting and opportunity tracking in Salesforce using MEDDIC qualification methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer onboarding and transition to implementation teams with ongoing technical guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customer sites as needed to support pre-sales activities and demonstrate technical expertise&lt;/li&gt;
