&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the sales process and ability to identify and advance opportunities through each stage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery and consultative selling skills, ability to ask probing questions and synthesize customer requirements into solution recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
