&lt;li&gt;Prepare board, leadership, and investor materials, including narrative, structure, and supporting data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance and Revenue Operations on budget and headcount planning, and support the coordination and reporting needs of global product and tech leaders without slowing functional velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communications and Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
