&lt;li&gt;Help managers effectively manage their teams pipeline through pipeline management, account planning and sales process coaching 1:1 and in manager-led forecast meetings as well as&amp;nbsp; deliver necessary ongoing training in these areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data to identify knowledge or skill gaps across the sales team&lt;/li&gt;
