&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other departments in order to provide information to sales teams on product, process, and other changes/updates that may affect the sales team as part of ongoing training &amp;amp; preparedness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish formal networks to drive functional business initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advises on strategy to accomplish unique works and coordinates the activities to implement with sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
