&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MLflow or similar experiment tracking platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI-integrated evaluation pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multi-agent orchestration frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work in an Applied AI or LLMOps function within a product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
