&lt;p&gt;The Smartsheet Portfolio Management Pillar is looking for curious and passionate Frontend and Fullstack Software Engineers. You will help us build enterprise-grade applications within the Portfolio Collaborative Work Management space, an area that grew 4x year-over-year. Our applications manages three areas that serve our customers: A feature-rich config management tool that allows power users the ability to create their business processes; A fast and reliable orchestration engine that runs millions of distributed transactions per day; A global management service that alters the attributes of Project assets and ensures the state of the Portfolio is running and updates are managed at-scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Engineering team members are passionate about working on multiple projects using several technologies. We are a self-operating service team and use a diverse set of Frontend (JavaScript, TypeScript, React), Backend (Ruby/Java), and Cloud-native services(AWS).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2005, Smartsheet was founded on the idea that teams and millions of people worldwide deserve a better way to deliver their very best work. Today, we deliver a leading cloud-based platform for work execution, empowering organizations to plan, capture, track, automate, and report on work at scale, resulting in more efficient processes and better business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to our Sr. Manager, Engineering, and may work remotely from anywhere in the US where Smartsheet is a registered employer.&lt;/p&gt;
