&lt;li&gt;Create a culture of inclusivity, recognizing the strengths that individuals bring to the team to promote engagement and development opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit to business needs, alongside recruitment partners, shaping and iterating to ensure the quality of talent attracted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Training team, as applicable, aligning on onboarding and assessment objectives and programs, through feedback and effective communication whilst sharing any skill gaps&lt;/li&gt;
