&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agent interoperability protocols and data platform governance tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience consolidating internal systems and managing build/buy/adopt decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI governance, agent identity, auditing, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Jira, Confluence, GitLab, and work-management tools at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
