&lt;li&gt;Experience building team culture and psychological safety across a remote, globally distributed organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience driving AI adoption within a design, research, content, or software delivery organization not just using AI tools individually, but setting org-wide AI strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
