&lt;li&gt;Experience finding simple, innovative solutions for complex problems, and facilitating research to uncover user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual design sense; design fluency sufficient to critique and direct design work at the strategic level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills; ability to influence across Product, Engineering, and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to articulate design decisions and advocate for the user, while balancing speed and innovation enabled by AI.&lt;/li&gt;
